Tap & Go.
The way to call Taxi has never been so easy.

Main features of the app as following: 
- locating of the passenger position by GPS;
- all drivers within the passenger area are able to see their bookings;
- notifying passengers with details of the vehicle that is picking them up and fare estimates;
- notifying passengers with a signal when a Taxi has arrived;
- real-time tracking of progress of a passenger vehicle on a map;
- rating drivers by the end of a trip;
- bonuses for the first and further trips which can be used as payments for trips;
- working referral system which provides additional bonuses for invitations of friends to use the application; 
- these bonuses can as well be used as payments for trips.

EST: Call Taxi is your reliable taxi app, working automatically in e.g. Abakan, Aktau, Anapa, Astana, Achinsk, Bratsk, Velikiy Novgorod, Volgograd, Irkutsk, Karasuk, Kirov, Klin, Krasnodar, Krasnoyarsk, Moscow, Nefteyugansk, Novokuznetsk, Novosibirsk, Noyabrsk, Nyagan’, Omsk, Pyt-Yakh, Pyatigorsk, Rostov on Don, Sayanogorsk, Surgut, Tayshet, Tuchkovo, Khanty-Mansiysk, Chelyabinsk, Shymkent.

Enjoy using the app any time and everywhere!

